# Playbook

Example of playbook.md: your rules, accounts and machine notes, part of every CoS and
lead system prompt. Copy it to playbook.md beside this file and make it yours (`fleet init`
seeds one if none exists). Rules: one per line, newest last; the CoS appends one only
after you approve it.

## Always ask me
- Merging to a main branch, deploying, deleting anything remote, spending money.

## Learned
- Leads may merge to dev once a human reviewer approved and required checks pass (approved 2026-01-15).

## Accounts
- Claude: every agent uses `~/.claude` for every company.
- Devin: `devin-as acme …` for Acme work (the `devin` skill).
- Codex: the default login in `~/.codex`.

## Companies and repos
- Acme: `$FLEET_WORK_ROOT/acme/{web,api}`; base branch `dev`, production `main`.

## Machine
- wt, gh, herdr-app, hc and devin are installed. No other machines (`hc machine ls` is empty).
